### Security Guidelines
- **Input Validation**: Ensure all user inputs (e.g., email, name, password) are validated against strict criteria. For example, use regex to validate email format and enforce minimum password length. 
  ```javascript
  if (!/^[\w-\.]+@([\w-]+\.)+[\w-]{2,4}$/.test(email)) throw new Error('Invalid email format');
  ```

- **Parameterized Queries**: Use parameterized queries for all database interactions to prevent SQL injection. Avoid concatenating user input directly into SQL statements.
  ```javascript
  this.db.run(`INSERT INTO merchants (email, name, password) VALUES (?, ?, ?)`, [email, name, password]);
